Homepage: https://github.com/thruput-io/gettoken
Description: token broker for AI agents - the privileged half
 token-requester is what runs once the agent's ask has crossed over. It says who
 is asking and what they are doing from the kernel rather than from anything the
 agent can set, signs the request, and hands it to token-service. It answers
 with the token alone: how long that token lasts is not the agent's to be told.
 .
 Beside it stands entitlements-requester, which does the same for the ask that
 names no capability and hands that one to entitlements. One door per ask, so
 neither has to work out which of two things it was asked.
 .
 Neither is a name on a public PATH. An agent reaches them by invoking gettoken,
 which is the only public name the components claim, and never by naming these.

